<title>MEXICO: Kimberly-Clark de Mexico 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Kimberly-Clark de Mexico 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>     Shr		  7.92			n/a</p>
<p>     Oper Income	2.553 bln		 2.418 bln</p>
<p>     Net		  2.129 bln		 1.445 bln</p>
<p>     Revs		 9.106 bln		 8.813 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>The full company name is Kimberly-Clark de Mexico, SA de CV.</p>
<p>The company said that the net profit per ADR for 1996 was 15.84 pesos.  </p>
<p>Kimberly-Clark manufactures and sells personal use and paper products.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728 9559))</p>
</text>
